WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:07.559
Hi my name is Reece I'm a councillor for
the villages Ward at Thanet District

00:00:07.559 --> 00:00:11.250
Council. One of the reasons why I wanted
to be a councillor was that I wanted to

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:15.629
effect positive change in my local area
and make sure that residents concerns

00:00:15.629 --> 00:00:19.740
and views were heard at district council
level. If you want to be a

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:24.120
councillor, if you want to stand up for
the views and the rights of your

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.570
community and the residents around you
then please do stand to be a

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:31.050
councillor. It's an absolutely
fantastic role to do, it's a great

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:36.030
opportunity - you learn so so much. It's just it is amazing it is

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:39.930
amazing and what I would say is
that we need more young people

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:44.490
here and we need the new young
generation of councillors to come in and

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:48.420
to bring a bit of life into this chamber
and ensure that this council is

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:51.090
prepared for the future.
So if you're young and you're

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:54.930
dedicated and you love where you live
and you want it to remain the wonderful

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.750
place that is then please consider
standing as a councillor.

